    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you remember those wooden puzzles where you have to move a ball through a maze to reach the goal? Well, this game is based on a similar premise: to reach the goal, you have to rotate the stage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Turn it Around</strong> is a gravity-based puzzle game where, in each level, you must solve a small labyrinth by rotating it left or right. As you progress, new mechanics will be introduced, refreshing the experience and gradually increasing the complexity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features <strong>45 different levels</strong>, each one more challenging than the last, until they become true tests of logic and skill that will keep you entertained for hours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve all the intricate puzzles and help the balls return to their homeland, <strong>Bolaland</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584170/extras/f839c0d2722cc445990efe5ac274ea7a.avif?t=1747891155\" width=100 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you remember those wooden puzzles where you have to move a ball through a maze to reach the goal? Well, this game is based on a similar premise: to reach the goal, you have to rotate the stage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Turn it Around</strong> is a gravity-based puzzle game where, in each level, you must solve a small labyrinth by rotating it left or right. As you progress, new mechanics will be introduced, refreshing the experience and gradually increasing the complexity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features <strong>45 different levels</strong>, each one more challenging than the last, until they become true tests of logic and skill that will keep you entertained for hours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve all the intricate puzzles and help the balls return to their homeland, <strong>Bolaland</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584170/extras/f839c0d2722cc445990efe5ac274ea7a.avif?t=1747891155\" width=100 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "Solve puzzles by turning the maze around. &quot;Turn It Around&quot; is a gravity-based puzzle game where you'll need to rotate the scene left or right to slide the balls to the goal. Navigate through increasingly challenging levels with a variety of evolving mechanics.",
